      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s first post office opened in 1888, and by that time Godley already had a gristmill, three cotton gins, and two dairy‑processing plants.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
